Your values caused the symbol to COMPLETELY miss the keycap surface. I experimented with some values via trial and error, here are some and the resulting SVGs attached. Give your BRUTALLY HONEST feedback, and tell me how it can be improved.

```
template: 1u-icon-main-plus-secondary

layer_1_main_icon:
  type: svg
  color: GR2 on GR10   # foreground on background
  size: 35
  rotate: 0
  position:
    x: 0.0
    x_from: center
    y: -0.5
    y_from: middle
  alignment:
    x: center
    y: middle

layer_2_secondary_icon:
